<style>
.robotic-section{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,var(--primary-light) 100%)}
.robotic-photo-block{margin-top:36px;text-align:center}
.robotic-photo{max-width:100%;width:100%;max-height:520px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.robotic-photo-caption{max-width:720px;margin:16px auto 0;color:var(--text-light);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7}
.robotic-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:30px}
.robotic-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-top:4px solid var(--primary);transition:transform .3s}
.robotic-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}
.robotic-icon{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1}
.robotic-card h3{color:var(--primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:10px}
.robotic-card p{color:var(--text-light);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px}
.robotic-link{color:var(--primary);font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
.robotic-link:hover{color:var(--primary-dark)}
.robotic-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}
@media(max-width:960px){.robotic-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<section class="section meet-surgeons-section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="welcome" style="text-align:center;color:var(--accent-gold);font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin-bottom:6px">Meet Our Surgeons</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">The Team Behind Ahmedabad's VELYS 4.0 Robotic Joint Programme</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Dr. Hardik M Shah and Dr. Swagat M Shah bring decades of combined orthopedic experience to every robotic knee replacement performed at DHS — supported by the VELYS 4.0 Robotic-Assisted Solution from Johnson &amp; Johnson.</p>

    <div class="surgeons-photo-block">
      <img src="/assets/i-am-giving-the-same-image-for-7th-time-.jpg" alt="Dr. Hardik M Shah and Dr. Swagat M Shah with the VELYS 4.0 Robotic-Assisted Solution from Johnson & Johnson at DHS Multispecialty Hospital" loading="lazy" class="surgeons-photo">
    </div>

    <div class="surgeons-grid">
      <div class="surgeon-card">
        <h3>Dr. Hardik M Shah</h3>
        <div class="surgeon-cred">FRCS (Germany)</div>
        <p>A senior orthopedic and joint replacement surgeon with extensive international training, Dr. Hardik Shah has led hundreds of successful robotic and conventional knee replacement procedures, known for his precise surgical technique and patient-first approach.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="surgeon-card">
        <h3>Dr. Swagat M Shah</h3>
        <div class="surgeon-cred">FIAAS (UK)</div>
        <p>Fellowship-trained in advanced arthroplasty and surgery, Dr. Swagat Shah co-leads the robotic joint replacement programme at DHS, combining deep clinical expertise with hands-on mastery of the latest imageless robotic platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="surgeon-card">
        <h3>VELYS 4.0 Robotic Solution</h3>
        <div class="surgeon-cred">Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes</div>
        <p>The VELYS 4.0 platform enables real-time, imageless intra-operative mapping — no pre-op CT scan required — giving Dr. Hardik Shah and Dr. Swagat Shah sub-millimetre precision on every robotic knee replacement they perform.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px">
      <a href="/doctors/" class="btn btn-primary">Meet the Full Surgical Team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.surgeons-photo-block{margin:30px auto 34px;text-align:center;max-width:900px}
.surgeons-photo{max-width:100%;width:100%;max-height:480px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.surgeons-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:10px}
.surgeon-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-top:4px solid var(--accent-gold)}
.surgeon-card h3{color:var(--primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:4px}
.surgeon-cred{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-gold);letter-spacing:.3px;margin-bottom:12px}
.surgeon-card p{color:var(--text-light);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7}
@media(max-width:960px){.surgeons-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-section">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/about/dhs-about.jpg" alt="DHS Multispecialty Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <div class="welcome">WELCOME TO</div>
        <h2>DHS Multispecialty Hospital</h2>
        <p>Welcome to DHS Multispecialty Hospital, your trusted hospital partner in Ahmedabad. DHS Multispecialty Hospital is a state-of-the-art advanced multispecialty hospital located in Vastrapur. DHS is a one-stop solution for secondary and tertiary care providing medical and surgical treatments with fully equipped 50 beds, 24x7 ICU & Emergency services.</p>
        <p>After 6+ years of providing comprehensive medical services, DHS hospital proudly stands out for its cutting-edge infrastructure and personalised treatment. Having treated 25,000+ indoor and 100,000+ outdoor patients, we have carved a niche among hospitals in Ahmedabad.</p>
        <p>DHS is a leading centre for <strong>robotic-assisted joint replacement</strong> in Ahmedabad — offering VELYS robotic knee replacement from Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes, led by Dr. Hardik M Shah and Dr. Swagat M Shah.</p>
        <p>DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers Mediclaim & Cashless services from major insurance companies for patient's ease.</p>
        <div class="nabh-badge">NABH Accredited Hospital</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Hospital Facilities</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Apart from clinical departments, DHS Multispecialty Hospital has many critical and crucial supportive facilities ensuring prompt and quality patient care.</p>
    <div class="facilities-grid">
      {% for facility in facilities %}
      <div class="facility-card">
        <img src="{{ facility.icon }}" alt="{{ facility.name }} at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50">
        <h3>{{ facility.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ facility.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Departments</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Our hospital is accredited by NABH, reflecting our dedication to quality, safety, and continuous improvement.</p>
    <div class="dept-grid">
      {% for dept in departments | head(8) %}
      <div class="dept-card">
        <img src="{{ dept.image }}" alt="{{ dept.name }} department at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="300" height="180">
        <div class="dept-card-body">
          <h3>{{ dept.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ dept.short_desc }}</p>
          <a href="/departments/{{ dept.slug }}/" class="btn btn-outline" style="font-size:.8rem;padding:6px 16px">Learn about {{ dept.name }} &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px">
      <a href="/departments/" class="btn btn-primary">View All Departments</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Doctors</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Meet our team of experienced and dedicated medical professionals.</p>
    <div class="doctors-grid">
      {% for doc in doctors | head(4) %}
      <div class="doctor-card">
        <img src="{{ doc.image }}" alt="{{ doc.name }} — {{ doc.specialty }} at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="300" height="250">
        <div class="doctor-card-body">
          <h3>{{ doc.name }}</h3>
          <div class="qualification">{{ doc.qualification }}</div>
          <div class="specialty">{{ doc.specialty }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px">
      <a href="/doctors/" class="btn btn-primary">View All Doctors</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reviews-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Patient Testimonials</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">What our patients say about their experience at DHS Multispecialty Hospital.</p>
    <div class="reviews-grid">
      {% for review in reviews %}
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <p>"{{ review.text }}"</p>
        <div class="source">— {{ review.source }} Review</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <a href="{{ site.google_reviews_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="google-review-badge">
      <div class="grb-logo">G</div>
      <div class="grb-info">
        <div class="grb-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <strong>4.9</strong></div>
        <div class="grb-text">Based on 2,000+ Google Reviews</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grb-cta">View Reviews &rarr;</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section aeo-faq-section" id="faq" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to know about DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Ahmedabad — answered clearly.</p>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What specialties does DHS Multispecialty Hospital offer?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers 15+ specialties under one roof including Orthopedics &amp; Joint Replacement, Cardiology, Neurosurgery, Oncology (Cancer Care), Gastroenterology, Urology, Pulmonology, Plastic &amp; Reconstructive Surgery, Critical Care (ICU), General Surgery, Internal Medicine, ENT, Ophthalmology, Nephrology, and Endocrinology. The hospital operates 24/7 with emergency and ICU facilities.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Is DHS Hospital NABH accredited?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes. DHS Multispecialty Hospital is NABH (National Accreditation Board for Hospitals &amp; Healthcare Providers) accredited — the gold standard for hospital quality and patient safety in India. NABH accreditation means the hospital is independently audited for clinical protocols, infection control, patient rights, and continuous quality improvement.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Does DHS Hospital offer robotic knee replacement?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes. DHS Multispecialty Hospital is one of the few hospitals in Ahmedabad to offer VELYS Robotic-Assisted Knee Replacement — an imageless robotic platform from Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes paired with the J&amp;J Attune knee implant. The programme requires no pre-op CT scan and delivers sub-millimetre alignment accuracy. It is led by Dr. Hardik M Shah (FRCS Germany) and Dr. Swagat M Shah (FIAAS UK), who have collectively performed 2,000+ knee replacement surgeries.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What health checkup packages are available at DHS Hospital?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">DHS offers seven health checkup packages tailored to different needs: DHS Advance Screening (basic screening with blood, liver, kidney, cardiac, and radiology tests), DHS Preventive (adds thyroid, HbA1c, vitamins, and PFT), DHS Comprehensive (adds USG Abdomen, T3/T4, Vitamin D, and orthopedic consultation), DHS Executive (adds 2D Echo, TMT, cancer markers PSA/CA-125), DHS Executive Plus (the most comprehensive — adds anemia profile, cardiac biomarkers like hs-CRP, Homocysteine, ApoLipoprotein), DHS Basic Cardiac, and DHS Advance Cardiac. All packages include physician consultation and report review. Call +91 9081610444 or <a href="/health-check-up/">view all packages</a> to book.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Does DHS Hospital accept cashless insurance?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes. DHS Multispecialty Hospital is empaneled with all major health insurance companies and TPAs in India, offering cashless hospitalisation for eligible policyholders. This includes coverage for surgeries such as knee replacement, cancer treatment, cardiac procedures, and more. For cashless eligibility or a pre-authorisation query, contact our billing desk at +91 9081021444 or visit our <a href="/cashless/">cashless insurance page</a>.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Where is DHS Multispecialty Hospital located in Ahmedabad?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">DHS Multispecialty Hospital is located at 18 Sunrise Park Society, Vastrapur Lake — Drive-in Link Road, Gurukul, Ahmedabad 380052. It is conveniently accessible from Vastrapur, Satellite, Bodakdev, Drive-In Road, and the SG Highway corridor. Free patient parking is available. <a href="/contact/">Get directions</a>.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What are the emergency and OPD timings at DHS Hospital?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">DHS Multispecialty Hospital's Emergency Department and ICU operate 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. OPD timings vary by department and consultant — please call +91 9081610444 or check our <a href="/appointment/">appointment page</a> for current schedules. Visiting hours for inpatients are 4 PM to 6 PM daily; ICU visiting is 5 PM to 6 PM.</div>
    </details>

    <div style="margin-top:30px;padding:20px 24px;background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);border-left:4px solid var(--primary);box-shadow:var(--shadow)">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--text-light)">Have more questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact our team</a> or call us at <a href="tel:+919081610444">+91 9081610444</a> — we're available 24/7.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <section id="localities-served">
      <h2>Robotic Knee Replacement Near Vastrapur, Satellite &amp; Bodakdev</h2>
      <h3>1. Serving Vastrapur, Gurukul &amp; Drive-In Road</h3>
      <p>Located at 18 Sunrise Park Society on the Drive-In Link Road, DHS Multispecialty Hospital is within 5 minutes of Vastrapur Lake and Himalaya Mall. Residents of Vastrapur and Gurukul can access advanced Johnson &amp; Johnson VELYS 4.0 robotic joint replacement without long travel times.</p>
      <h3>2. Accessible from Satellite &amp; Mansi Circle</h3>
      <p>Just 1.5 km via Premchand Nagar Road, patients from Mansi Circle, Satellite, and Ramdev Nagar can consult senior robotic joint surgeons Dr. Hardik Shah and Dr. Swagat Shah. We provide 24-hour mobility protocols and full cashless insurance support.</p>
      <h3>3. Minutes Away from Bodakdev &amp; Sindhu Bhavan Road</h3>
      <p>Connected directly via S.G. Highway and Judges Bungalow Road, DHS Hospital offers imageless VELYS robotic knee surgery (no CT-scan radiation) for patients in Bodakdev, Pakwan Cross Roads, and Sindhu Bhavan.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--primary);color:#fff;text-align:center">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px">Need Medical Assistance?</h2>
    <p style="opacity:.9;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 25px">Our team of expert doctors is available 24/7 for emergencies. Book an appointment or call us now.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:15px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-accent">Book Appointment</a>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phones.emergency }}" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--primary)">Call: {{ site.phones.emergency }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
